---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
---

<Section class="pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="grid gap-0 border-t border-hairline md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline py-10 md:border-r md:border-b-0 md:pr-12 md:py-12">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-cobalt">Train</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[1.25rem] font-medium tracking-tight">Serious engineering education.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Practitioner-led training for teams who have to ship. A catalogue covering foundations, engineering, RAG, agents and architecture — shaped to your organisation, not a public timetable.
      </p>
      <a href="/training" class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-ink no-underline hover:text-cobalt">
        Training
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="py-10 md:py-12 md:pl-12">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-cobalt">Build</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[1.25rem] font-medium tracking-tight">Bespoke systems, when a product is not the whole answer.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Agents, RAG, copilots and applications designed around existing systems. Where Platform and the specialist applications already cover the problem, we start there. Where they do not, we still build.
      </p>
      <a href="/build" class="mt-6 inline-block font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] text-ink no-underline hover:text-cobalt">
        Build
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
